{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こめんとありがとー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の質問は正解者が多かったですねぇ素晴らしい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"答えは、\nあらってあげて！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って感じで使います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛犬のポテトを洗おうか迷ってて、あらっちゃりーやぁー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って使ったので、是非皆さんに答えてもらおうとおもって質問してみたよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じ広島でも、\n洗ってやりんさい！\n洗ってあげんさい！\nなど、ありますが、私のところは、\nあらっちゃりーや！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って使います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみさんのお母様から頂いた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『人気焼き』\nというものです！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これがなんとものすごく美味しくて\n幸せでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみさん！そして、お母様！\n有り難うございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかげで、すごく幸せな一日でした    気持ちも"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"happy"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、宿題もはかどりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここだけの話！かずみさんのお母様！物凄く綺麗でスラッとしててビックリした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃくちゃ綺麗だった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"清潔感あふれてる感じ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"happybirthday"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おくれてごめんね！\nいつも、優しくしてくれて、\n嬉ーですっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくっ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいすきよんっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\n畠中さんとかき氷をたべてたら、\n畠中\n『頭いたい』\n和田\n『なんで？大丈夫？』\n畠中\n『かき氷一気に食べた』\n和田\n『何故一気に食べた？\n私、かき氷で頭いたくなったことない！』\n畠中\n『うそやん！いっきにたべて！』\n和田食べ終わった！\n和田\n『ぜんぜんいたくない！』\n畠中\n『動物やん！』\n和田\n『いや！人間だし！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果私は動物らしい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私を動物に例えるとなんだろー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のタイトルは、一番と二番目の方が、考えてくださったタイトルを使用しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイトル文字数に制限があって、少ししかかけないのー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんのを使いたいんですけど......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもありがとー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/25/1753775/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁここらへんで、\nせーのっ！\nばーーーーぁいっっ！"}],"source":"archive"}